@startuml SEQ_10_MENGELOLA_PENILAIAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-10: Mengelola Penilaian Tugas

actor       "Admin / Asisten"            as User
boundary    "Browser"                    as Browser
control     "PengumpulanTugasController" as Controller
entity      "PengumpulanTugas Model"     as ModelPT
entity      "NilaiRubrik Model"          as ModelNR
entity      "TugasPraktikum Model"       as ModelT

== Lihat Semua Submission Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka halaman tugas, tab "Penilaian"

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/submissions

Controller -> ModelT   : Query tugas + komponen rubrik
ModelT --> Controller  : Data tugas
Controller -> ModelPT  : Query semua submission
ModelPT --> Controller : Data submission
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman penilaian
Browser    --> User    : Tabel: praktikan, status, nilai, aksi

== Nilai Manual (Satu Nilai Total) ==

User    ->  Browser    : Isi nilai angka pada baris praktikan

Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/pengumpulan/{id}/grade {nilai, catatan}

Controller -> ModelPT  : update({nilai, catatan, dinilai_at})
ModelPT --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Nilai Per Komponen Rubrik ==

User    ->  Browser    : Isi nilai per komponen rubrik

Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/pengumpulan/{id}/nilai-rubrik\n{nilai_komponen}

Controller -> ModelNR  : updateOrCreate per komponen
ModelNR --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelPT  : update({nilai: total, dinilai_at})
ModelPT --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Total nilai ter-update

== Nilai Matrix (Semua Praktikan Sekaligus) ==

User    ->  Browser    : Isi tabel matrix nilai semua praktikan per komponen rubrik

Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/tugas/{id}/nilai-matrix\n{nilai_matrix}

Controller -> ModelNR  : updateOrCreate per sel matrix
ModelNR --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Kolom nilai ter-refresh

== Reject (Tolak) Submission ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Tolak" + isi alasan penolakan

Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/pengumpulan/{id}/reject {catatan}

Controller -> ModelPT  : update({status: 'ditolak', catatan, dinilai_at})
ModelPT --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Status berubah "Ditolak"

== Export / Import Rekap Nilai ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Export Nilai"

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/tugas/{id}/export-nilai
Controller --> Browser : Response file Excel download
Browser    --> User    : File rekap nilai diunduh

User    ->  Browser    : Upload file Excel nilai (bulk import)

Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/tugas/{id}/import-nilai {file: Excel}
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Tampil notifikasi sukses

@enduml